# FILE SIZE / CONTENT NOTE
# ===========================================================================
# The large data sections above are intentional. They provide a single-file
# content foundation for the next stage of the project: replacing procedural
# placeholder art with individual 16x16 / 32x32 / 48x48 / 64x64 pixel sprites,
# adding sprite sheets, and moving story records into external data files.
#
# For a production build, these generated data sections should eventually be
# moved into JSON or Python modules. Keeping them here right now makes this
# prototype self-contained and easy to copy to another computer.
#
# Recommended next assets:
#   1. Julia / May / Yumi character sprite sheets
#   2. Zombie sprite sheets
#   3. The Smiler sprite sheet
#   4. Pistol and rifle sprite sheets
#   5. Alcatraz tiles
#   6. San Francisco rainy tiles
#   7. Graveyard tiles
